# YouAreUnstoppable

The unit is a day, not a habit. Streaks are derived from completed days.

Before API work, read `docs/domain.md` and `docs/implementation.md`.

- The only live route is `GET /api/hello`. Document a route only after the handler exists.
- Phase 1 is the frontend prototype and needs no new endpoints.
- Phase 2 adds users, transformations, days, and journal. Streak, day status, and rates live in services.
- Phase 3 adds Google auth, the coach, and Stripe.
- The coach is short advice from identity and recent days, not a chat log.
- Free stays useful. Pro is $9.99/month and adds the full year, history, plans, and coach.
- Do not commit `.env` files or credentials.
